[h1]Net Reliability[/h1]
[b]Fixes lost packets in multiplayer: faster world loading on Wi-Fi, long distances and other lossy connections.[/b]
Works with Host World, dedicated servers and Steam friend joins. [b]Everyone (server and all players) needs this mod and [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3558238376]Mod Settings Lib[/url].[/b]

[h2]The problem[/h2]
Necesse sends network data as UDP packets with no retransmission. Packets over about 1 KB are split into several pieces; if one piece is lost, the whole packet is thrown away and the game waits 2 seconds before asking again. On a lossy connection, terrain around you loads slowly and in patches.

[h2]What it does[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Lost pieces are resent at once:[/b] the receiver asks for exactly the missing pieces, the sender resends only those. No extra traffic when nothing is lost.
[*][b]Fixes a vanilla bug[/b] where a split packet whose first piece arrives late can never be completed.
[*][b]Bigger network buffers[/b] so bursts of map data are not dropped by the operating system.
[*][b]Experimental KCP transport[/b] (off by default): when joining a server by IP, the whole connection runs over KCP, a reliable protocol, so even single lost packets are resent. Turn it on in the mod's settings page.
[*]Measurement tools for admins: [i]/netrel status[/i] (server) and [i]/netrelc status[/i] (your client).
[/list]

[h2]Measured[/h2]
Time to load the area after a teleport, with simulated loss on the server-to-player direction:
[table]
[tr][th]Loss[/th][th]Vanilla[/th][th]This mod[/th][th]KCP (experimental)[/th][/tr]
[tr][td]0%[/td][td]1.1 s[/td][td]1.1 s[/td][td]1.1 s[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]10%[/td][td]5.1-6.4 s[/td][td]2.3-2.6 s[/td][td]1.1-1.2 s[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]20%[/td][td]10.0-12.2 s[/td][td]3.4-3.7 s[/td][td]1.2 s[/td][/tr]
[/table]
Measured on one machine (localhost); real networks also add latency.

[h2]Notes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Settings: Settings > Mod settings > Net Reliability in game; timings and testing options are in [i]cfg/mods/a632079.netreliability.cfg[/i]. Each machine uses its own settings.
[*]KCP: a player with KCP on can only join servers that run this mod. Steam friend joins never use KCP.
[*]On a dedicated server the log shows "Error loading mod patch class ... SteamSendPatch". That is expected: dedicated servers have no Steam networking.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]Net Reliability 网络可靠性[/h1]
[b]修复多人游戏丢包：Wi-Fi、远距离等网络不稳定时，地图加载更快。[/b]
支持「主持世界」、独立服务器和 Steam 好友加入。[b]服务器和所有玩家都需要安装本 Mod 和 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3558238376]Mod Settings Lib[/url]。[/b]

[h2]问题[/h2]
Necesse 用 UDP 传输网络数据，而且没有重传。超过约 1 KB 的包会拆成好几片发送，只要丢了一片，整个包就作废，游戏要等 2 秒才重新请求。网络不稳定时，周围的地形加载得又慢又零碎。

[h2]功能[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]丢了的分片马上补发：[/b]接收方只请求缺的那几片，发送方只重发这几片。没有丢包时不产生任何额外流量。
[*][b]修复原版 bug：[/b]分片包的第一片晚到时，这个包永远拼不齐。
[*][b]调大网络缓冲区：[/b]避免成批的地图数据被操作系统丢掉。
[*][b]实验性 KCP 传输[/b]（默认关闭）：通过 IP 加入服务器时，整个连接改用可靠协议 KCP，单个包丢了也会重传。在本 Mod 的设置页里打开。
[*]给管理员的测量工具：[i]/netrel status[/i]（服务器）、[i]/netrelc status[/i]（本客户端）。
[/list]

[h2]实测[/h2]
传送后周围区域加载完成的时间（模拟服务器到玩家方向的丢包）：
[table]
[tr][th]丢包率[/th][th]原版[/th][th]本 Mod[/th][th]KCP（实验性）[/th][/tr]
[tr][td]0%[/td][td]1.1 秒[/td][td]1.1 秒[/td][td]1.1 秒[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]10%[/td][td]5.1-6.4 秒[/td][td]2.3-2.6 秒[/td][td]1.1-1.2 秒[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]20%[/td][td]10.0-12.2 秒[/td][td]3.4-3.7 秒[/td][td]1.2 秒[/td][/tr]
[/table]
在单台机器上测得（本机回环），真实网络还会有额外延迟。

[h2]说明[/h2]
[list]
[*]设置：游戏内 设置 → Mod 设置 → Net Reliability；时间参数和测试选项在 [i]cfg/mods/a632079.netreliability.cfg[/i] 里。每台机器各用自己的设置。
[*]KCP：打开了 KCP 的玩家只能加入装了本 Mod 的服务器。Steam 好友加入不使用 KCP。
[*]独立服务器的日志里会出现 "Error loading mod patch class ... SteamSendPatch"，这是正常的：独立服务器没有 Steam 网络功能。
[/list]
